<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45675" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔφεσος</span></b> , ἡ,
			<u>Ephesus</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.142
		</span></i>, etc.:—Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφέσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			γράμματα</span> a <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>magic</i> formula, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.706e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1864.16
			</span></i> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφεσήϊα</span></b> , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxil.
					18.7
				</span></i>
			 (anap.)): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφεσία</span></b> ,
				ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστολόχεια στρογγύλη</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.4
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτεμισία</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				113
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφέσια</span></b> , τά, festival of Artemis at Ephesus, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.104
			</span></i> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφέσεια, τά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				10.10
			</span></i>): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφεσηονίκης</span></b> 
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], ὁ</span>, victor in these games, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ephes.</u>
				2.72
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφεσίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, in pl., title of poem by <i><span class="en">
				Aeschrio
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				688
			</span></i>.</div>
